This repository uses the CUAD dataset (Contract Understanding Atticus Dataset)
for contract clause classification.

CUAD is curated and maintained by The Atticus Project
(https://www.atticusprojectai.org/cuad/) and shared under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0).  The dataset was annotated
with the input of legal experts from The Atticus Project, and its method is
described in "CUAD: An Expert-Annotated NLP Dataset for Legal Contract Review"
by Dan Hendrycks, Collin Burns, Anya Chen, and Spencer Ball
(arXiv:2103.06268, Findings of ACL 2021).

Reuse CUAD in keeping with the CC BY 4.0 terms, which require that you credit
the source and indicate any changes:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
